flowchart LR
  Client[HTTP client] --> Middleware[Request ID, limits, CORS, tracing]
  Middleware --> Routes[Axum route handler]
  Routes --> Auth[Bearer token or access cookie]
  Auth --> Service[Domain service]
  Service --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  Service --> Queue[Jobs queue when task is asynchronous]
  Routes --> Response[JSON, redirect, or empty response]
  Response --> Client
